+ * @remarks
+ * The installed portfolio either writes through `captureFrame` or records nothing, so neither mode
+ * lets a proof see the document a frame is shot in: the staged pane, the content edge, and which
+ * parts of the page are laid out. This portfolio implements the installed interface minimally to
+ * observe that moment. It shoots nothing, writes nothing, refuses nothing, and resolves every
+ * placement with no path, the way a disabled portfolio does.
